---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About"
	description="Yeh Bro is a faceless, Australia-first fitness brand: evidence-first natural lifting, legal sports nutrition only."
>
	<article class="prose-wrap">
		<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
		<h1>Straight talk. AU gym maths.</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			Yeh Bro is a faceless content brand for natural lifters who want evidence and AUD reality — not
			hype reels and mystery blends.
		</p>

		<h2>Who we are</h2>
		<p>
			No face-cam coach energy. We publish guides, comparisons, and short-form scripts built on label
			facts, consensus dosing, and what you can actually buy and ship in Australia.
		</p>

		<h2>How we pick products</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Evidence and clear labels over marketing copy</li>
			<li>Dose you can verify — proprietary blends are a red flag</li>
			<li>AU availability and price per effective dose</li>
			<li>Legal sports nutrition only (creatine, protein, pre/intra, basics)</li>
		</ul>
		<p>We are not pay-to-rank. Sponsored posts, if any, get labelled separately.</p>

		<h2>What we don’t do</h2>
		<div class="skip-flag">
			<p>
				We do not promote illegal AAS, restricted SARMs, unapproved peptides, underground lab gear,
				or “cycle / blast / PCT” product funnels. Comment bait for sources gets refused.
			</p>
		</div>

		<h2>Affiliate relationships</h2>
		<p>
			Some links use <code>/go/</code> redirects. If you buy, we may earn a commission at no extra
			cost to you. Full policy on <a href="/disclosure">Disclosure</a>.
		</p>

		<p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/start-here">Start here</a></p>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
